# Pairs with SagaSettles. The restore arms the redirect on the shadow the alias
# now names instead of the copy it left, so a saga re-bound to the shadow is
# refused by the copy the tree resolves to.
MODULE: SagaSettlesArmsAliasCopy
TARGET: SagaSettles
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the cutover arms the copy the alias moved onto
PERTURBS: Arm

--- FIND
    /\ redir' = [redir EXCEPT ![P] = S]
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the wrong copy is armed.
    /\ redir' = [redir EXCEPT ![S] = P]
--- END